Homepage: https://github.com/fstronin/hwmtb-gt-logo-control

Package: hwlogo
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.8), kmod
Suggests: acpi-call-dkms
Description: HUAWEI MateBook lid "logo light" control (DKMS module)
 Controls the illuminated HUAWEI wordmark on the lid of the MateBook GT 14
 (ENZH-XX) and compatible models by driving the embedded controller through
 the firmware's own ACPI method \_SB.PC00.LPCB.HWEC.ECCD (the same path the
 vendor's Windows PC Manager uses).
 .
 The DKMS module exposes a standard LED class device
 /sys/class/leds/huawei::logo, a hwlogo(1) command line tool, and an optional
 systemd unit that re-applies the state at boot.
 .
 Secure Boot is not affected: the module is signed automatically with the
 machine's enrolled MOK key by DKMS.
